Third-party components
----------------------
The document service (/v1/documents/*) depends on the following packages.
They are installed as dependencies, not vendored into this repository; the
Docker image redistributes them under their own licenses:

- pypdfium2 (Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause), bundling PDFium binaries
  (BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0) with permissively licensed third-party code:
  Abseil, fast_float, llvm-libc (Apache-2.0); AGG 2.3, FreeType (FTL),
  ICU (Unicode-3.0), Little CMS, libjpeg-turbo (IJG/BSD), libpng, OpenJPEG,
  simdutf, zlib. The full texts ship in the wheel's dist-info/licenses.
- Pillow (MIT-CMU / HPND)
- python-docx (MIT) and lxml (BSD-3-Clause)
- python-multipart (Apache-2.0)
- reportlab (BSD-3-Clause), test/development dependency only

No GPL/AGPL component (e.g. PyMuPDF) is used by the core.
